<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Documentation on projectious.work brand</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand/docs/</link><description>Recent content in Documentation on projectious.work brand</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://projectious-work.github.io/brand/docs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Tokens</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand/docs/tokens/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand/docs/tokens/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The token files are the machine-readable form of the
&lt;a href="https://projectious-work.github.io/brand/docs/foundations/"&gt;foundations&lt;/a&gt;. They are &lt;strong&gt;MIT-licensed&lt;/strong&gt; —
the values are free to use, the marks are not. See
&lt;a href="https://projectious-work.github.io/brand/docs/governance/licensing/"&gt;Licensing&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="downloads"&gt;Downloads&lt;/h2&gt;
